      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_333cc1db0b84ca315c6fe9ebc127b79df301ce8702110eaf156842478494d1bf"
      ],
      "text": "Séance is a GTK4 terminal multiplexer for Linux that auto-detects Claude Code, Codex, Pi, OpenCode, and Antigravity CLI sessions running inside it and tracks their status live in a sidebar."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3c3752a63ed9393219506eed404d3fc8949dec80ea99af47b476b12b04d8edd7",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 165,
          "line_start": 163,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L163-L165"
        },
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 31,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L31-L31"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_15ddd20c23c73dada11b32bfd7b3511dfd200b6d3660ac20a78c971e485c0daa",
        "slc_6ecae7f6977169d538fb2c21ba880a6e5bb92b10dad077e26b76f17805f0805b"
      ],
      "text": "Terminal rendering is GPU-accelerated via libghostty (Ghostty used as a library), and the app is built with Zig, GTK4, and libadwaita."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_27e25a6d258d5404d5927eade9e5fa7cb9bed22f2c8586a636f2c75d07b756c3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 35,
          "line_start": 35,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L35-L35"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_56d2a2f3b9f1a0cb46519eea12d7fbeb700a88533ba4b7f1f53c65e000365de1"
      ],
      "text": "Panes are arranged in a horizontally scrolling strip, a layout model borrowed from niri, described as fitting long linear agent sessions better than a tiling grid."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_edd8647667664411b743c2f02e1f5ed4ca3b6a8c1aef1bed7faa31699fbe158e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 74,
          "line_start": 74,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L74-L74"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d9e6a8a8b867bb20936a8ee0b7b6685d988d9bda0042898a43a9bbb7ab44bbf1"
      ],
      "text": "Every action is available through `seance ctl`, which talks to the running instance over a Unix domain socket; scripts can create workspaces, open panes, send input, read terminal output, and query the session hierarchy, with JSON output for all commands."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_048c54e97869dc7b77a73ae335767c79d87b866705adf3aa9ad9a75f31dafa47",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "skills-patterns",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 76,
          "line_start": 76,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L76-L76"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_867638dadab9a7752aa283c22d2408a114c32e5198709a1402ceebaa19fc3c2d"
      ],
      "text": "A bundled skill file (skills/seance-skill.md) provides AI agents a complete reference for the seance ctl API so they can operate the multiplexer on their own."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_68d285b24c93ee4585c1ea420859df5bd63b8e22b6ca6ad58644bb26ca2fc7ad",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 60,
          "line_start": 54,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L54-L60"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2ae792e5dad4976af9c47954595d05749f3e1365139e80f8d7646f0abe0df316"
      ],
      "text": "Antigravity CLI tracking uses its status-line callback, which the wrapper adds to ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/settings.json on first launch, keeping a backup at settings.json.seance-backup."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4c9ff3aee28a9357e53c014246fb19988679dfe1317be7855c5d9c35b52db31b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4",
          "git_sha": "94c659a66d3c242016a194de56034c3a15c46c61",
          "line_end": 52,
          "line_start": 46,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "no1msd/seance",
          "url": "https://github.com/no1msd/seance/blob/f3b74415085d6ef8627ec3f3faba5152f06569b4/README.md#L46-L52"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_21c357ed76f4b72c9bad2f4bffe9b27c9f7829afaace43e033c1c37219ab41e1"
      ],
      "text": "Remote `opencode attach` sessions and `--pure` OpenCode launches are not tracked."
    },
