        "slc_f4701464d624cde74bb3b74e8525ed1b9b8b2427d4fe655024977cab3179c32d"
      ],
      "text": "The product includes workspaces, session persistence across restarts, tabs within columns, a command palette, focus-follows-mouse, and no telemetry; F11 toggles fullscreen and the header bar hides in fullscreen."
    }
